kosha robotics-varga

  -- root cluster for all robotics domain nodes.
  -- robotics is physics (kinematics, dynamics) enacted through computation (control, planning).
  -- the kinematic chain IS the scene-graph: geometry + physics + algorithm together.

  -- domain identity
